    "title": "Twilite's Readiness for n8n-Style Automation",
    "description": "Research findings on whether Twilite’s existing scripting and execution facilities are sufficient to support n8n-style workflow automation (triggers that fire, actions that run, data that flows between nodes), compared against how n8n actually works.",
