      "data": {
        "title": "Twilite's In-Browser Execution Already Covers n8n's Code-Node Equivalent",
        "claim": "The contested assumption on the n8n-style-automation-template idea graph — that existing script/task machinery might suffice to actually run a workflow — is partially confirmed: a sandboxed script that can read and write real graph state already exists and works, comparable to n8n's Code node.",
