    {
      "id": "twilite-automation-readiness-mechanism",
      "type": "topic-mechanism",
      "label": "How a Script Actually Runs",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -1800,
        "y": 1360
      },
      "width": 400,
      "height": 280,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "How a Script Actually Runs",
        "mechanism": "A script node's text runs inside a sandboxed iframe, isolated from the host page. It talks back to the host exclusively through postMessage RPC calls, each carrying a per-run token so the host can distinguish and rate-limit calls from a specific run.",
        "conditions": "The graph must be open in a live browser tab; the script node must have allowMutations enabled for its RPC calls to actually persist changes (dryRun otherwise).",
        "definitionKey": "topic-mechanism",
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "topic-mechanism",
          "sourceRef": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/topic-template/classes/nodes/topic-mechanism.node-class.node",
          "defaults": {
            "label": "Mechanism",
            "size": {
              "width": 480,
              "height": 380
            },
            "showLabel": false,
            "data": {
              "title": "",
              "mechanism": "",
              "conditions": "",
              "steps": "",
              "failureModes": "",
              "documentation": ""
            },
            "ports": [
              {
                "id": "root",
                "label": "root",
                "direction": "bidirectional",
                "dataType": "any",
                "angle": 180
              }
            ]
          },
          "nodeDef": {
            "key": "topic-mechanism",
            "ref": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/topic-template/classes/nodes/topic-mechanism.node-class.node",
            "source": "local",
            "version": ">=0.5.0",
            "defaults": {
              "label": "Mechanism",
              "size": {
                "width": 480,
                "height": 380
              },
              "showLabel": false,
              "data": {
                "title": "",
                "mechanism": "",
                "conditions": "",
                "steps": "",
                "failureModes": "",
                "documentation": ""
              },
              "ports": [
                {
                  "id": "root",
                  "label": "root",
                  "direction": "bidirectional",
                  "dataType": "any",
                  "angle": 180
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "views": [
            {
              "key": "topic-mechanism",
              "intent": "node",
              "payload": "node.web.detail",
              "ref": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/topic-template/classes/nodes/topic-mechanism.node-class.node",
              "source": "local",
              "version": ">=0.2.0",
              "defaultPorts": []
            },
            {
              "key": "topic-mechanism",
              "intent": "node",
              "payload": "node.web.summary",
              "ref": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/topic-template/classes/nodes/topic-mechanism.node-class.node",
              "source": "local",
              "version": ">=0.2.0",
              "defaultPorts": []
            },
            {
              "key": "topic-mechanism",
              "intent": "node",
              "payload": "node.web.icon",
              "ref": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/topic-template/classes/nodes/topic-mechanism.node-class.node",
              "source": "local",
              "version": ">=0.2.0",
              "defaultPorts": []
            },
            {
              "key": "topic-mechanism",
              "intent": "editor",
              "payload": "editor.web",
              "ref": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/topic-template/classes/nodes/topic-mechanism.node-class.node",
              "source": "local",
              "version": ">=0.2.0",
              "defaultPorts": []
            }
          ]
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "topic-template"
        },
        "steps": "1. Script text compiled via new Function('api', ...) inside the sandboxed iframe.\n2. Script calls an RPC method (getNodes, createNode, updateNode, createEdge, deleteNode, applyDeltas, ...) via postMessage.\n3. Host (usePluginRuntime.js handleScriptRequest) checks the per-run token and the run's remaining mutation budget.\n4. Host forwards the call to the real GraphCRUD mutation class, which is the same mutation surface the UI itself uses.\n5. Result (or error) is posted back to the sandboxed iframe.",
        "failureModes": "A run that exceeds the 15s timeout or the 200-RPC-call cap is presumably terminated/rejected (exact enforcement point not traced further); a script without allowMutations can call mutation RPCs but they run as dryRun and do not persist.",
        "documentation": "components/GraphEditor/Scripting/ScriptRunner.js, components/GraphEditor/hooks/usePluginRuntime.js, components/GraphEditor/Scripting/SCRIPTING.md (confirmed to match the code, not aspirational)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twilite-automation-readiness-synthesis",
      "type": "topic-synthesis",
      "label": "Executable While Open, Not Yet Unattended",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": -1200,
        "y": 1900
      },
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "bidirectional",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Executable While Open, Not Yet Unattended",
        "summary": "Twilite's scripting facilities are not fully up to n8n-style automation today, but the shape of the gap is precise, not total: real sandboxed script execution, a real mutation API, and a real (if snapshot-ish) data-flow engine already exist — all of it scoped to a live, open browser tab. What's genuinely missing is any server-side trigger surface: no webhook, no cron, no unattended execution of any kind, and the one path that reaches Twilite from outside a live tab (MCP) is deliberately propose-only and never auto-applies.",
        "openQuestions": "If a server-side trigger surface is built, should it call directly into GraphCRUD-equivalent mutation logic server-side, or should it go through something like the existing MCP propose/approve path (which would mean unattended automation still can't run without a human in the loop, undercutting the point)? That tension isn't resolved by this research and belongs on the n8n idea graph's own next steps.",
        "definitionKey": "topic-synthesis",
        "_classBinding": {
          "key": "topic-synthesis",
          "sourceRef": "github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/topic-template/classes/nodes/topic-synthesis.node-class.node",
